@startuml
left to right direction

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {

    usecase "View room\navailability" as UC1
    usecase "Book room" as UC2
    usecase "Cancel own\nbooking" as UC3
    usecase "Block or\nunblock room" as UC4
    usecase "Review room\nusage" as UC5
    usecase "Receive\nconfirmation" as UC6

    ' why: R4 says every successful booking produces a confirmation
    UC2 ..> UC6 : <<include>>

    ' why: US-06 says confirmation is also received after cancellation
    UC3 ..> UC6 : <<include>>
}

Student --> UC1
Student --> UC2
Student --> UC3

Administrator --> UC4
Administrator --> UC5

note right of UC2
R1: Future start
Duration > 0 and <= 2 hours

R2: No overlap with active
bookings for the same room

R3: Blocked room cannot
accept a new booking
end note

note right of UC6
R4: Successful booking
produces confirmation
end note

@enduml